      "text": "if iniquity abound, cursed be land for people’s sake, 2 Ne. 1:7 (Jacob 2:29). cursed is he who puts trust in arm of flesh, 2 Ne. 4:34 (28:31). cursed shall be seed of him who mixes with Lamanites’ seed, 2 Ne. 5:23. how much more cursed is he who knows God’s will and does it not, Alma 32:19. cursed be land forever unto workers of darkness, Alma 37:31. cursed are people because they set hearts upon riches, Hel. 13:19–21.",
